    },
    {
      "textEn": "Simplified form of 報. Pictograph of a kneeling person (卩) being forced by a hand (又) into shackles (㚔). Based on the original meaning \"punish\". The meaning later shifted to \"revenge\", \"recompense\", \"report\", and \"announce\".",
      "source": "dictionary.json",
